<main id="main" class="page-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="page-title">API v1</h1>
    <p>REST API used by the website itself. JSON responses <code>{ ok, message, ... }</code> or errors <code>{ error, code, fields }</code> with proper HTTP codes (400 validation, 401, 403 RBAC, 404, 409 business rule, 422, 429 rate limit). Mutations require the <code>X-CSRF-Token</code> header (value of the <code>ap_csrf</code> cookie). OpenAPI spec: <a href="/openapi.json" style="color:var(--blue)">/openapi.json</a>.</p>
    <p>Real-time: Socket.IO at <code>/socket.io</code> · client events <code>join {lotId|eventId}</code>, <code>sync</code>, <code>bid {lotId, amountCents, idempotencyKey}</code> · server events <code>lot:update</code>, <code>lot:closed</code>, <code>event:update</code>, <code>notification</code>.</p>
    <% Object.keys(groups).forEach(function (g) { %><h2 style="margin-top:26px;font-size:19px"><%= g %></h2><div class="table-wrap"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th style="width:80px">Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Description</th><th>Access</th></tr></thead><tbody><% groups[g].forEach(function (r) { %><tr><td><span class="badge badge-<%= r[0] === 'GET' ? 'blue' : r[0] === 'DELETE' ? 'red' : 'green' %>"><%= r[0] %></span></td><td><code><%= r[1] %></code></td><td><%= r[2] %></td><td><%= r[3] %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><% }) %>
  </div>
</main>
